diff --git a/docs/bots.md b/docs/bots.md
index e85defd..c66f4f5 100644
--- a/docs/bots.md
+++ b/docs/bots.md
@@ -139,3 +139,23 @@ successful delivery across network or worker failures.
 ```sh
 bin/rails test test/models/user/bot_rooms_test.rb test/models/room/bot_webhook_test.rb
 ```
+
+## Per-member bot limit
+
+Administrators configure **Bots per member** on `/account/edit`. This uses the
+account's JSON settings, with a default of 5 for both existing and new accounts;
+no data migration is needed. Zero blocks all new member-owned bots. Administrators
+are exempt from the limit.
+
+The quota counts each creator's non-deactivated bots. Deleting a bot frees a slot;
+lowering the limit never removes or prevents editing existing bots. The bots
+page hides **Add a chat bot** at or above the limit, and a creation-only model
+validation also rejects direct submissions (including forms opened before the
+limit changed). The check uses the bot's creator, not the current session user.
+
+Regression tests:
+
+```sh
+bin/rails test test/models/user/bot_limit_test.rb test/models/account_test.rb test/controllers/bots_controller_test.rb test/controllers/accounts_controller_test.rb
+bin/rails test test/system/bots_test.rb
+```
